<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Account Blocked — Trendupp</title>
    <style>
      body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
        background-color: #f4f4f7;
        color: #333;
      }
      .container {
        max-width: 580px;
        margin: 40px auto;
        background: #ffffff;
        border-radius: 12px;
        overflow: hidden;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      }
      .header {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ef4444 0%, #b91c1c 100%);
        padding: 36px 40px;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .header h1 {
        margin: 0;
        color: #ffffff;
        font-size: 22px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: -0.3px;
      }
      .body {
        padding: 36px 40px;
      }
      .body p {
        font-size: 15px;
        line-height: 1.7;
        margin: 0 0 16px;
        color: #555;
      }
      .body p strong {
        color: #333;
      }
      .block-box {
        background: #fef2f2;
        border-left: 4px solid #ef4444;
        border-radius: 6px;
        padding: 16px 20px;
        margin: 24px 0;
      }
      .block-box p {
        margin: 0;
        color: #991b1b;
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 14px;
      }
      .footer {
        background: #f9f9fb;
        padding: 24px 40px;
        text-align: center;
        border-top: 1px solid #ebebf0;
      }
      .footer p {
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #aaa;
        margin: 0;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        <h1>🚫 Account Blocked</h1>
      </div>

      <div class="body">
        <p>Hi <strong><%= firstName || 'there' %></strong>,</p>

        <p>
          We regret to inform you that your Trendupp Creator account has been blocked.
        </p>

        <div class="block-box">
          <p>Reason: <strong>Repeated Campaign Violations (Reached 3 strikes from different advertisers)</strong>.</p>
        </div>

        <p>
          Per our platform quality policy, creators who receive 3 strikes from different advertisers due to rejected revised draft content or failing to publish live links are suspended from the platform.
        </p>

        <p>
          You will no longer be able to log in, apply to campaigns, or receive new payments. If you have outstanding funds in escrow, an administrator will contact you regarding mediation.
        </p>

        <p>
          If you wish to appeal this decision, please reply to this email or contact support at
          <a href="mailto:support@trendupp.com">support@trendupp.com</a>.
        </p>

        <p>— The Trendupp Team</p>
      </div>

      <div class="footer">
        <p>
          You are receiving this email because your account at
          <strong>trendupp.com</strong> has been deactivated.<br />
          © <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Trendupp. All rights reserved.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
